    { q: 'How do I start preparing for a competitive exam?', a: 'Begin with the official syllabus and recent papers. Understand the pattern, marking and weightings before you study anything, then build a weekly plan that covers the whole syllabus with time to revise and test.' },
    { q: 'How many hours a day for competitive exam prep?', a: 'Consistency beats marathon days. Many successful candidates do a sustainable block of focused hours daily for months rather than cramming. The number matters less than keeping it up without burning out.' },
